{"results":[{"url":"https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/WFRBLB50107","final_url":"https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/WFRBLB50107","title":"Net Worth Held by the Bottom 50% (1st to 50th Wealth Percentiles)","description":"Graph and download economic data for Net Worth Held by the Bottom 50% (1st to 50th Wealth Percentiles) (WFRBLB50107) from Q3 1989 to Q2 2026 about net worth, wealth, percentile, Net, and USA.","language":"en","text":"Skip to main content\n\n\n\n\n# Net Worth Held by the Bottom 50% (1st to 50th Wealth Percentiles) (WFRBLB50107)\n\nObservations\n\nQ2 2026: 4,278,038 |\nMillions of Dollars, Not Seasonally Adjusted |\nQuarterly\n\nUpdated:\nSep 18, 2026\n2:41 PM CDT\n\nNext Release Date:\nNot Available\n\nObservations\n\nQ2 2026:\n4,278,038\n\nUpdated:\nSep 18, 2026\n2:41 PM CDT\n\nNext Release Date:\nNot Available\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Q2 2026: | 4,278,038 |  |\n| Q1 2026: | 4,153,074 |  |\n| Q4 2025: | 4,135,838 |  |\n| Q3 2025: | 4,079,083 |  |\n| Q2 2025: | 3,997,218 |  |\n| View All | |\n\nUnits:\n\nMillions of Dollars,\n\nNot Seasonally Adjusted\n\nFrequency:\n\nQuarterly\n\n\n\n\n\nFullscreen\n\n**Data in this graph are copyrighted. Please review the copyright information in the series notes before sharing.**\n\n## Notes\n\n**Source:**\nBoard of Governors of the Federal Reserve System (US)\n\n**Release:**\nDistributional Financial Accounts\n\n**Units:** \nMillions of Dollars, Not Seasonally Adjusted\n\n**Frequency:** \n\nQuarterly\n\n#### Notes:\n\nThe Distributional Financial Accounts (DFAs) integrate two data products produced by the Federal Reserve Board: the Financial Accounts of the United States, which provide quarterly data on aggregate balance sheets of major sectors of the U.S. economy, and the Survey of Consumer Finances (SCF), which provides comprehensive triennial microdata on the assets and liabilities of a representative sample of U.S. households.  \nInformation on the data collection process can be found at the Board of Governors.\"\n\n#### Suggested Citation:\n\nBoard of Governors of the Federal Reserve System (US),\nNet Worth Held by the Bottom 50% (1st to 50th Wealth Percentiles) [WFRBLB50107],\nretrieved from FRED,\nFederal Reserve Bank of St. Louis;\nhttps://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/WFRBLB50107,\n.\n\n## Release Tables\n\nDistributional Financial Accounts\n\n* Levels of Wealth by Wealth Percentile Groups\n\n## Related Data and Content\n\n##### Permalink/Embed\n\nmodal open, choose link customization options\n\nSelect automatic updates to the data or a static time frame. All data are subject to revision.\n\n  \n\nBack to Top\n\n### Subscribe to the FRED newsletter\n\n### Need Help?\n\n---\n\nLegal\n\nPrivacy Notice & Policy","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":663.2058359973598,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}